<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #d9534f;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Meter Offline Alert</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            <p>We've detected that your meter (<strong>{{meterNumber}}</strong>) has lost connection to our system and is currently <strong>offline</strong>.</p>
            <p>This may be due to a power outage, internet connectivity issues at the installation site, or a technical fault. While the meter is offline, you may not be able to monitor usage or control the valve remotely.</p>
            <p>We will notify you once the meter comes back online. If the issue persists, please contact our support team.</p>
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
